#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:56
#: d06da2f690424039b114b677580a911d
msgid "Safety Button"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:57
#: 871fac5f0f314786ab9ab9b8cbe0802b
msgid "SkySakura H743 supports safety button, with connection via sh1.0 6 pin connector, with buzzer and safety led on the same connector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:59
#: 64adb66be2b34e80bfb1416da01ab816
msgid "Safety button is defaulted to be disabled but can be enabled by setting the following parameter:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:61
#: be2217022c7f48e48138f74d5455c1d6
msgid ":ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT<BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` = 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:64
#: e9142c2cb79e4bec9191242e7199ffba
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:65
#: 2ec2213a44894073b04b11472e91c9ff
msgid "RC input is configured on UART4 with an sh1.0 connector. It supports all RC protocols except PPM. The SBUS pin on the HD VTX connector is tied directly the UART4 RX. If RC is used on UART4, then the SBUS lead from a DJI VTX must not be connected to an SBUS to prevent the RC from no working."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:68
#: 13579b1d2c33478cb084e7a18493c6ca
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:69
#: 1a8cceca98004ef68b9eec1ba25477f1
msgid "SkySakura H743 supports HD VTX DisplayPort OSD through UART6 by default. Set :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 5."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:72
#: 7579071fd22c4e529f8b676795758e21
msgid "VTX Power Control"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:73
#: 66a34d94d1ce47fe91085813b4f62188
msgid "The 12VSW output voltage on the HD VTX connector is controlled by GPIO 85, via RELAY1 by default. Relay 1 Low activates the voltage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:76
#: 955c4b43901d40aba39000594f2b058a
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:77
#: 1f59c4ec315d43dba604affb55603cd9
msgid "The SkySakura H743 has 13 PWM outputs. M1-M8 are linked to sh1.0 8 pin connectors. The first 8 outputs support bi-directional DShot and DShot. Output 9-13 only support non-DShot protocols and 13 is configured as NEOPIXEL LED by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:79
#: 1b221a06c28045c696a46a50ae7c8a95
msgid "The PWM are in in two groups:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:81
#: 9e8dfdbcf56640e990fac2d7e2a0f602
msgid "PWM 1-2 in group1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:82
#: 944481894fab46dea9f4648d48498e13
msgid "PWM 3-4 in group2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:83
#: 42fe0e71a9d5444f88d32cace78b2b06
msgid "PWM 5-6 in group3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:84
#: 5c8afcdfd7ba40009a91268f7e5f2bc3
msgid "PWM 7-8 in group4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:85
#: 41f9ca136e8d47d0a2888e784559fbe5
msgid "PWM 9-12 in group5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:86
#: 1480cc5a0db044e1b079b6f6ef724ba0
msgid "PWM 13 in group6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:88
#: 3e354994340d4f0d91a0053757283216
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:93
#: bc1063ce3038432db6aeec436e587626
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:94
#: afd55c0d095544e397811999c3ad4e78
msgid "The board has a builtin voltage sensor and external current monitor inputs. The voltage sensor can handle up to 12S LiPo batteries. The current sensor scale's default range is 120A, but will need to be adjusted according to which sensor is used. These inputs are present on the first ESC connector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:96
#: e9c4d786d82e40318b76a27cdf3ff70e
msgid "A second battery monitor can be also used but must be enabled. Its voltage sensor is capable of reading up to 6.6V maximum and is available on the A3 solder pad. Its current monitor input is on the A4 solder pad."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:98
#: a243de6d455c4934b3bb243e742f04fd
msgid "The default battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:100
#: 550e73c854b64399bbc46fcf9c111064
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:101
#: 5c5bc119884143048b85748e68f97fc0
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:102
#: a37a880653904b2dbd1968b45e014c09
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 34"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:103
#: 04c3066731c947bc853a1dd0986d5fe3
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:104
#: e8e16b34b08148e78e52a6474572e2d8
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 40"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:106
#: 3bf098ea5d6344f4aec99d46e59a6bd6
msgid "A second battery monitor can be enabled:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:108
#: c540560345674e929fc320d8147c1173
msgid "set :ref:`BATT2_MONITOR<BATT2_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:109
#: d08a0ce5ea77404bb0e86dc3275b3f5b
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_VOLT_PIN<BATT2_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:110
#: d0495c08fcde48c389446218548c5f91
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_CURR_PIN<BATT2_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:111
#: 990267ebcac04ee59d1c704460873536
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_VOLT_MULT<BATT2_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:112
#: a22cb78eae9148eb9e1f7ff8fcdbbd9f
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_AMP_PERVLT<BATT2_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` set  to appropriate value for second current sensor"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:115
#: b56a298672ae4bf0b2653b5beefd6157
msgid "Compass"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:116
#: 99edea3cd1d745fb8ba0ad934aaa4916
msgid "The SkySakura H743 has a built-in IST8310 compass. Due to motor interference, users often disable this compass and use an external compass attached via the external SDA/SCL pins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:119
#: 6c5901e26b2445c39444547e83f4ed4e
msgid "NeoPixel LED"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:120
#: d028dcd27d9c44c6931633c75b21a07e
msgid "PWM13 provides external NeoPixel LED support by default but can be re-configured as a normal motor/servo output."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:123
#: e603b5ea89b34dab968e99658f7b6762
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:124
#: 221f4c6b579943679c206f07dd017f02
msgid "Firmware can be found on the `firmware server <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__  in the \"SkySakuraH743\" folders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:127
#: 7315054dca6e47d486792f40cbc15bdc
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:128
#: 9659913ce73045baa13f6ce24870f636
msgid "Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:132
#: e730c7deea8f42eba4fd71a6f1c50a7e
msgid "Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr ""
